# after_prep_exclude.voc — de/em + article contractions (do, no, num …).
# Subtracted from AFTER_PREP: they signal a NOUN phrase, so they are NOT valid
# complements of the prepositions para/pelo/sobre. Rarely needs extending.
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

da
das
do
dos
na
nas
no
nos
num
numa
numas
nuns
